Read and follow CLAUDE.md in the project root for all code generation.
Key rules:
- React NEVER calls external APIs directly — all requests go through FastAPI backend
- All 4 agents run as async functions via asyncio.gather with 3-second timeout
- LLM is called ONCE per briefing by Profile Agent — all logic runs before it
- DEMO_MODE=true is the default — must work 100% offline from static JSON
- Shelter data is hardcoded in shelters.json — never fetched live, never modified
- Caching: in-memory Python dict with TTL (no Redis, no file cache)
- Frontend: React 18 + TypeScript strict + Tailwind CSS + React Query
- Backend: Python FastAPI + Shapely + pandas
- Never display false-precision shelter headcounts — Open/Filling/Near Full only
- Git: conventional commits (feat:, fix:, docs:, chore:)
